Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:44.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's keep those hammers working.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:03.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:09.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,过来吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.85,0:01:29.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗?强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.85,0:01:32.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.85,0:01:37.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:41.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,强尼 很抱歉让你受这种苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, I'm sorry they sent you to such a hellhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:42.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:45.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,你己受够了是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you have, haven't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:49.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,强尼 我告诉过你 我会帮你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, I told you that I'd help you when I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.87,0:01:53.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,你很特别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.87,0:01:59.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,你绝不能在未来的五年还待在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't possibly wanna stay here for another five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.89,0:02:07.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,至少我知道站在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here at least, I know where I stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.89,0:02:10.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,先听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just hear me out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.89,0:02:13.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿有一项任务展开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A covert operation is being geared up in the Far East.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.89,0:02:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your name
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是电脑选中的三人之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was dug out of computer as one of three most able to complete the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:21.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么任务?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:27.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,再前往越南搜索被俘的人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recon for POWs in Nam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:32.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,为何现在 为何要我去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why now? Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:35.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,从俘虏营中逃出来的人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The prison camp you escaped from in '71 is the target area.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:38.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有你知道俘虏营所在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody knows that terrain better than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,危险性非常高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The risk factor is very high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:44.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,你将暂调军部 等任务成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd be temporarily reinstated in the Forces,and if the mission's successful
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.93,0:02:49.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,总统也许会大赦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there may be a presidential pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.93,0:02:55.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有兴趣吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:02:59.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good...good. .
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:04.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,我去安排一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get the necessary clearance
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次我们见面时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next time we meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 将是在泰国作战总部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it will be in Thailand with the Special Ops designate who runs the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:10.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.95,0:03:12.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白了吗 - 是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All clear? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:13.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,强尼 我要你知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, I want you to know that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.95,0:03:16.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是要救你出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did what I could to keep you outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:19.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:22.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:25.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,这次会赢吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we get to win this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.97,0:03:31.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,这次看你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time, it's up to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:57.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,《第一滴血2》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:46.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:48.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗?蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doin', Rambo? I'm Ericson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.11,0:05:53.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,何不去那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we make it over to the hangar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:56.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还是入选者是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the chosen one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:59.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可是使自己够出名了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made a helluva rep' for yourself in Nam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:03.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,总之 我很高兴与你共事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, I'm glad to be workin' with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:04.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里虽不是天堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place may not be heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.12,0:06:09.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,但至少可使你愉快的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but at least you're out of the joint!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:16.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:18.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 午安 强尼 - 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Morning, John. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:20.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,这位是摩道少将{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Marshal Murdock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:22.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是华盛顿派来指挥这任务的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} He's in charge of Special Operations from Wahington.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:23.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 中校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:25.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波 我正在等你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo, been looking forward to meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,旅途如何?没问题吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was your trip? No problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.33,0:06:27.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,还好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.15,0:06:29.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然这里天气很热 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for the damned heat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:30.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never felt anything like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:35.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,进来 我们谈正事吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on in, let's get down to business!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:39.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看过你的资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was glancing over your files.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:44.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,真是很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Makes some pretty interesting reading!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.17,0:06:49.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波约翰生于47年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo, John J., born 7.6.47,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:53.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,是亚利桑那印第安与德国人混血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bowie, Arizona, of Indian-German descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:55.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,真复杂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a helluva combination!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.18,0:06:57.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,在64年加入陆军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joined the army 8.6.64,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.18,0:06:59.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,入特种作战部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}accepted special forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:01.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,特长:轻武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}specialization: light weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:04.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,曾受医疗训练 有医疗士资格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cross-trained as medic. Helicopter and language qualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.18,0:07:08.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为单独力杀59名敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}59 confirmed kills, 2 silver stars, 4 bronze, 4 Purple Hearts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.19,0:07:11.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,获得勋章一枚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}distinguished service cross, and Medal of Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.19,0:07:16.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,你很出风头对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got around, didn't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:18.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波 你可能知道还有一千五百{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo, you're probably aware that there's almost 2.500 Americans
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:19.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,美国人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}still Missing In Action
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:20.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,在越南失踪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in South-East Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:23.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,大部分己战死的 家庭会死心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of these boys are presumed killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.20,0:07:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但仍有许多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but to the legal families,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国家庭抱着希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congress and lots of Americans, it's still a very emotional issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:31.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,有没有什冰凉的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimme something cold, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.21,0:07:34.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波 你可能不太了解我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo, you certainly don't know as much about me as I do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:38.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在66年带过海军陆战队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've honched with the 2nd Battalion,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:40.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,第二步兵营{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3rd Marines, in Kon Tum in '66.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:42.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我损失了不少的好人手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost a lot of good men
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.22,0:07:43.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,因此 我知道你们的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I know what you and every vet feels now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:45.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许政府没照料到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe the government didn't care
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:48.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许大众不关心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe certain segments of the population didn't care,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.23,0:07:50.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是我会在意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but my committee cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:53.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,因此大家要知道他们是否健康{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what his commitee needs is exclusive proof that Americans are being held.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:56.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我们要把他们救回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once done, rest sure we'll get 'em back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:59.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是我方人员去俘虏营四周{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if there's any of our men at this POW target camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:02.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,摄到的地图照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll confirm their presence by taking photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Photographs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.24,0:08:06.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有照片 任何情况下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.25,0:08:09.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,不能跟敌人交手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under no circumstances are you to engage the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.25,0:08:11.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是要救他们回来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm supposed to leave'em there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.25,0:08:14.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我重覆一次 别跟敌人交手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat: do not engage the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:15.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救出行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phase 2, Delta Force assault team
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:19.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要由翰特中校来处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}led by Colonel Trautman will handle the extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:24.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:25.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,总之以你的作战经验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, I'd just like to say that I feel with your participation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.27,0:08:29.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我相信成功率是很高的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this mission has a better than average chance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:32.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,最好还是冒个险看你是否能完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to succeed where others have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.27,0:08:37.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我一小时候在指挥部见你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll meet you both in the operations center in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:58.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,泰国金兰湾起飞在越南山区着陆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From Thailand, across Laos, into the mountains of Vietnam, to the drop zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:01.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要从250尺高空上跳下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be flying a ceiling of 250 feet when you bail out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:03.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会处理吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you can handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:04.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:06.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,你单身前往{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you're going in solo,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:09.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,必须依赖很多你从未用过的设备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll have to rely on more equipment than you ever used before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.31,0:09:13.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,去用吧!我说的是不要好斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And use it!What I'm sayin' is don't try the blood-and-guts routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:16.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,用点知识来作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let technology do most of the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:20.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 我要你记住任务重于战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, I want you to try to forget the war.Remember the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.32,0:09:22.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你己在越南死去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old Vietnam's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:27.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我是个活人且仍然活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I'm alive, it's still alive, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:41.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也许不相信 但这一切都为你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may find this hard to believe, but all this is for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.34,0:09:44.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是个萤幕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides modern computer devices you can see here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.34,0:09:48.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是确保你安危的设备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}issued every other modern piece of equipment we have to ensure your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:49.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波 你会很安全的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo, you can feel totally safe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:54.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们有最精良的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because we have the most advanced weapons in the world available to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.35,0:09:57.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,最具威力的武器是头脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always believed that the mind's the best weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,时代变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Times change.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:02.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,对某人而言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:04.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,别因我而打断了 中校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let me interrupt you, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:07.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,本部是由卫星传送资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Upon insertion, call in to base camp on Transat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:10.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后由地面人员接收{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then proceed to Point Hawk September to rendezvous with the ground contact:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.37,0:10:13.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,这就是由你接收{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indigenous agent Co Bao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:15.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:20.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,是由你接收{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indigenous agent Co Bao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:28.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,中校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:30.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,你确定他脑筋正常吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure he's still not unbalanced from the war?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't afford to have him involved
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.91,0:10:35.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有如下地狱般的压力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in this mission,he might crack under the pressure in that hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:39.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波是我看过最好的战争人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pressure?Let me just say that Rambo is the best combat vet I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:44.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,不只有战争武器 也有好的战术脑力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pure fighting machine with only a desire to win a war that someone else lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.40,0:10:46.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果要他死 他会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If winning means he has to die
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.41,0:10:49.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有任何恐惧 没有后悔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'll die. No fear, no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:54.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有 对你们有如下地狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...one more thing:What you choose to call "Hell",
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:11:00.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,对他有如他回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he calls home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:05.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,传命 开动ATU{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by!Start A.P.U.!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:32.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有20分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D minus 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:06.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,五分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D minus 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.49,0:12:09.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,(火药)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:20.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有36小时进出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got 36 hours to get the hell in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:24.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,别拖时间好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So don't stop to smell the roses, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:25.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you run into any trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻跑至指定的山顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}try to get to the hilltop extraction site marked on your map.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.63,0:12:30.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了 中校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to roll, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:38.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝好运 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good luck, son. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:42.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:44.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,还记得摩道少将说他在65年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember Murdock said he'd been with the 2nd Battalion,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.52,0:12:47.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,指挥过陆战队吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}third Marines in Kon Tum in '66?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.23,0:12:48.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.53,0:12:53.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,第9营人员全阵亡了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 2nd Battalion was at Kud Sank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:58.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是我唯一信任的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only one I trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:38.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想他会找到人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think he'll find someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:40.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,他一定会找到俘虏的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}POWs? Doubtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:41.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了令人满意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's people to satisfy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:45.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我为何要回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}questions that have to be answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:47.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,你说的口气很冷淡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't sound too emotional about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:49.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是我的战争 中校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't my war, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:54.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是你擦干净的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just here to clean up the mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:39.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,地上的联络员说他们在等待飞机 还有一分钟下降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}AWACS two-five has acquired.They're holding timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:44.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道了 完毕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Affirmative, Wolf Den. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:19.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,又回地狱了 各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back in the badlands, my man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:22.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备 就位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by your position!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:23.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,15秒钟跳下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insertion in 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:28.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,到时候了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Partytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:39.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,五秒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.83,0:15:40.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,四{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:41.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.70,0:15:46.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 跳下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two...Jumper away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:15:58.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:02.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,钩住了 他被吊着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A turbulence! He's hung up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:05.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要把他割断才行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be torn apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:07.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,紧急事件 他吊住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Condition Red! He's hung up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:09.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思? - 发生什么事情了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean he's hung up? - What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:11.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,他卡住了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's being dragged!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:14.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们把他割断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lifer cut him loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.73,0:16:19.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't free him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:38.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,快停止任务实施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ericson, abort the mission! Pull out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:44.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果不分开会害死他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll kill him! He'll be torn apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.76,0:16:50.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在割断了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's cutting away his equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:16:59.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,他出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:01.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是龙火一号 收到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in here, this is Dragonfly one. Do you read me, over?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:03.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,龙火一号 我收到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragonfly one, come in, I read you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.78,0:17:05.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,有没有照到任务相片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any visual bearing by flares?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:11.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我们什么也看不见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative. We didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:17.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想目前只有停止任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe the smartest thing to do is to abort the mission right now
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:19.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,以免发现太多的后遗症{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before there's any more complications.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:21.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁还能在这种情况下生存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean who could've survived something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:23.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在来说还过早{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He deserves the benefit of the doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:26.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,他有36小时出完任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got 36 hours to complete the mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:28.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,并到指定地点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and reach the extraction point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:29.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们都欠他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We owe him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:32.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Of course, we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.81,0:17:34.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,但了解一点吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But understand something now:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.81,0:17:40.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,36小时要作完一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 36 hours, we pull out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:26.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.94,0:19:40.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,没想到是女人吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did not expect a woman, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.94,0:19:46.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.95,0:19:48.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,去河里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go to river.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:51.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么来的这么晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come you so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.95,0:19:57.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我被吊住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got hung up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.96,0:20:03.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,必须坐船 一路上都不安全的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have arranged boat to take us down river. Old ways not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:09.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,你从老远来要找俘虏营{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come a long way,Rambo, to see empty camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:02.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,海盗用这些吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're using pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.32,0:21:07.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是河的下游 必须有小艇来警戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best way down river.Not get army suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.41,0:22:31.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹在那里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about patrol boats?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.43,0:22:55.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,俄制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.46,0:23:24.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波 要吃吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo!Want to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.46,0:23:29.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,还是等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.48,0:23:39.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,你何时开始这任务的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you get into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.48,0:23:41.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,说来话长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.48,0:23:46.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,也花了够久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.49,0:23:49.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,在我离开特战部队后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...after I left the Special Forces, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.49,0:23:53.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,我就退后了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...moved around a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.49,0:23:57.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为何离开陆军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you leave army?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.50,0:24:00.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我回美国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...came back to the States,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:03.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,发现了另一场战争在持续着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and found another war going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.50,0:24:07.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What war?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.51,0:24:11.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,有点像静态的战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of like a quiet war.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.51,0:24:14.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,是种反对返乡士兵的战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A war against...all the soldiers returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.51,0:24:19.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,这种战争是赢不了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the kind of war you don't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.52,0:24:24.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's...It's my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.52,0:24:27.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,你呢?你如何进入这事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you? How did you get into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.53,0:24:32.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲是情报员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father worked for intelligence agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.53,0:24:37.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,他死后 我取代他的位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He killed, and I take his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.54,0:24:42.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,死了太多人 到处都是死人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's too much death here.Death everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.55,0:24:50.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只想活下去 蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to live, Rambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.55,0:24:55.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许可以去美国过着安静的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe go America! Live the quiet life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.56,0:25:01.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.56,0:25:06.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,赢及生存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To win...to survive...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.57,0:25:11.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是你生存的理由这里仍有战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so easy to survive. Still war here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.57,0:25:14.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,生存的战争一定会成为战争的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To survive a war, you gotta become war.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.57,0:25:19.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,因此他们才选你 因你好战吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That why they pick you? Because you like to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.58,0:25:25.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可以舍身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.59,0:25:30.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,舍身是什意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expendable?What mean "expendable"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.59,0:25:37.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,就好像有人请你参加派对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like......someone invites you to a party
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.60,0:25:40.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you don't show up
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.60,0:25:45.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,其实也没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.61,0:25:51.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.61,0:25:55.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,会给我带来好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It bring me good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.62,0:26:00.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么替你带来好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What bring you good luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.63,0:26:10.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想是这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.63,0:26:15.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,没消息 再多连联络几次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No further report.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.64,0:26:18.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要去救出他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to go up with the extraction team at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.64,0:26:20.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 否决  - 否决?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Denied. - Denied?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.64,0:26:21.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是冒不必要的危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an unnecessary risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.64,0:26:22.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们有程序的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a schedule to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.64,0:26:25.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,管他的 我们还不知他是否活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Who?! We don't even know if Rambo's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.65,0:26:26.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,答案是反对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The odds are against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.65,0:26:30.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你说我们照计行事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said we'd go through as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.65,0:26:34.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧!你要作下去 会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, if you want to go through with it, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.65,0:26:39.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,中校 将要加入攻击组{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Colonel's gonna be joining the extraction team.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.66,0:26:44.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个好人 翰特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a damned good man, Trautman!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.72,0:27:42.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,看 是个大帐蓬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? Camp empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.72,0:27:47.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,我走近点看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We move closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.77,0:28:35.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,村子来的妓女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cyclo-girl whore from village.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.78,0:28:42.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,来吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.79,0:28:54.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.79,0:29:00.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,弓箭 没声音的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bow. No sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.80,0:29:08.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不能进去 你不是要照相吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You not going in there.But I thought you're supposed only to take pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.81,0:29:10.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,那命令呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.81,0:29:16.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more orders, Co.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.04,0:32:59.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是来帮你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come to get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.04,0:33:04.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要出声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.07,0:33:35.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 就在那里 - 我会回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There are others. - I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.15,0:35:00.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}GO
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.17,0:35:14.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.17,0:35:19.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.21,0:35:51.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,可以走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.21,0:35:54.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,一小时要完成行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minus one hour to extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.21,0:35:57.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,希望不会浪费燃料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope for his sake we're not just wasting fuel...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.22,0:36:02.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.24,0:36:24.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,还好你来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good thing you came when you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.24,0:36:26.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.25,0:36:27.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,那探索经常移动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They move us around a lot, to harvest crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.25,0:36:30.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在那里才一星期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only been there a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.25,0:36:32.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,就是你在集中营的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was the last time you were in that camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.25,0:36:34.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 一年前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A year...yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.25,0:36:36.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,今年是几年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What year is it, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.26,0:36:41.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,一九八五年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1985.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.26,0:36:45.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,集中营应该是没人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camp supposed to be empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.26,0:36:46.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,应该是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, supposed to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.43,0:36:47.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.30,0:37:25.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们很快会沿河追来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}L.Z. two klicks up river.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.36,0:38:26.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What has happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.37,0:38:29.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们被出卖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.37,0:38:34.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.41,0:39:08.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.41,0:39:09.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要和他们打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.41,0:39:14.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump! Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.46,0:40:10.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,快冲过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gunboat!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.48,0:40:30.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,约翰!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.50,0:40:43.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们成功了 蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made it, Rambo!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.53,0:41:18.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我们要继续走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C'mon! You take this. We go on from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.54,0:41:20.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要留到最后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It better I stay to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.54,0:41:22.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是最后了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.54,0:41:25.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.54,0:41:27.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.55,0:41:32.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是牺牲品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You not expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.57,0:41:57.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,中校 还有三分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel, 3 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.65,0:43:12.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Rambo!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.65,0:43:20.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!他找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ, he's found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.69,0:43:50.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,司令部 蓝波找到我们的人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relay the command.Rambo's found one of ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.69,0:43:52.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙号地勤人员报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Murdock, Dragonfly reports that ground crew
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.69,0:43:56.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,找到一个美军战俘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has what appears to be an American POW with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.70,0:43:57.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say???
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.70,0:44:00.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,他找到我们的人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got one of ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.70,0:44:02.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,他老给我们找麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This station is now on Condition Bravo. Harrison, Meyers, Goodell, out!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.70,0:44:05.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,电讯留下 其他的人出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.70,0:44:07.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.71,0:44:08.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是优先紧急事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to your COMINT priority frequency!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.71,0:44:12.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,把麦克风给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimme the mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.71,0:44:17.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙号这里是教练一号有命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragonfly, this is Coach 1. This is an Alpha-Kilo-Victor command priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.72,0:44:24.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要你立刻停止执行命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to abort the mission immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.72,0:44:27.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我再说一次 撤回命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say again, this is a recall. Confirm. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.73,0:44:30.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,再说一次 教练一号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say it again, coach 1, say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.73,0:44:32.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要你中止行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tellin' you to abort!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.73,0:44:35.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,中校 我们奉命在接人以前中止行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel!I've been ordered to abort before pick-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.73,0:44:38.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,雷达 我们正看到他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murdock, Murdock, for Christ sake, we've got 'em in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.74,0:44:43.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,你听到了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murdock, do you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.74,0:44:44.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.74,0:44:50.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,你那儿也不去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.75,0:44:52.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些该死的佣兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You goddamned mercenaries!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.75,0:44:55.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,下面有人是我们的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's men down there! OUR men!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.75,0:44:56.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!是你的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, your men.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.76,0:45:02.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要充英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.76,0:45:07.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,中校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.77,0:45:12.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.81,0:45:51.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.81,0:45:53.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你作了什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what the hell you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.81,0:45:56.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,别一副无辜的样子你早就怀疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't act so innocent, Colonel!You had your suspicions
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.82,0:45:59.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果如此 你也算是共犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if you suspected then, you're sort of an accessory, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.82,0:46:02.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,我从未相信过你 太保{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ever count me with you and your scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.82,0:46:03.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着 对不?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a lie, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.82,0:46:06.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像那该死的战争 他还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juste like the whole damn war. It was a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.83,0:46:08.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.83,0:46:12.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,那集中营应该是没人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That camp was supposed to be empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.83,0:46:14.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波进去 这是个装饰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo goes in, a decorated Vet,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.83,0:46:17.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,他如没找到 国会就会相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he finds no POWs, the Congress buys it, case closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.84,0:46:18.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,若他被抓住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he happens to get caught
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.84,0:46:21.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,除了你没人知道他还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no one knows he's alive except
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.84,0:46:23.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你就可把这件事抹杀了对不?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you and your computers, and you can reprogram that, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.84,0:46:26.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你在对谁说话?队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell do you think you're talkin' to, Trautman?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.85,0:46:29.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个腐败的官僚 他想掩饰臭事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A stinking bureaucrat who's tryin' to cover his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.85,0:46:33.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,不光是我的问题 这是国家事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not just mine,Trautman! We're talkin' about the nation's!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.85,0:46:35.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,况且你的战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, it was your hero's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.97,0:46:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是去作什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now if your warrior had gone in,and done what the hell he was supposed to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.86,0:46:43.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,很简单 他应该去拍照的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'd be out of this clean and simple!He was just supposed to take pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.86,0:46:44.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果那照片上有些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if those pictures showed something,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.86,0:46:47.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,是否也会被毁掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they would have been...lost, wouldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.87,0:46:51.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想你还是不了解这是怎回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Trautman, I still don't think you understand what this is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.87,0:46:53.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道是为了什么 是为了钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same as it always is: money.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.87,0:46:56.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,在七二年我们应该赔偿五千万战事修复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In '72, we were supposed to pay the Cong 4.5 billion in war reparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.88,0:47:00.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不同意他们就扣留了美军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We reneged, they kept the POWs.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.88,0:47:03.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,你又在重覆那件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're doing the same thing all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.88,0:47:05.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你会怎么作?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell would you do, Trautman?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.88,0:47:07.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,拿贿赂去赎自己的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pay blackmail money to ransom our own men,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.89,0:47:10.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,财力支援战力来对抗同盟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and finance the war effort against our allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.89,0:47:13.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果一个战俘突然在六点新闻出臭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if some burnt-out POW shows up on the 6 o'clock news?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.89,0:47:15.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要怎么办?再引起一场战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you wanna do?Start the war all over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.89,0:47:17.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要报仇而大家高喊着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna bomb Hanoi,wanna everybody screaming
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.90,0:47:19.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,威力进犯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for armed invasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.90,0:47:22.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,你以为会有参议员像从前一样出来说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think civilians are gonna get up on the floor of the United States Senate,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.90,0:47:23.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,要求数十亿元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ask for billions of dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.90,0:47:25.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,就为了几个遗忘的鬼魂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a couple of forgotten ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.90,0:47:28.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,是人 天杀的 是为国家而战的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men, goddamn it! Men who fought for their country!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.91,0:47:30.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.91,0:47:36.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想把这次谈话给忘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trautman...I'm gonna forget this conversation ever took place.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.92,0:47:39.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你这混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.92,0:47:41.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若我是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.44,0:47:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会再回去救他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd never make the mistake of bringing this subject up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.92,0:47:45.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,犯错的是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one who's making the mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.92,0:47:48.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?什么错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? What mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.93,0:47:54.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.63,0:48:54.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死的苏俄混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damned Russian bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.65,0:49:21.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,他死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.66,0:49:33.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,把他带上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring him up!The knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.69,0:49:56.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些人真野蛮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people are so vulgar in their methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.69,0:50:01.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们没有同情心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They lack compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.70,0:50:06.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是克洛诺波多夫斯基中尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Lieutenant-Colonel Podovski.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.70,0:50:11.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还不知道你是谁但我会知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know who you are yet,but I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.71,0:50:16.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,把他清洗一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him and clean him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.74,0:50:49.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.75,0:50:51.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 维特队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Captain Vinh.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.75,0:50:57.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,请留下一个卫兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave one guard, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.75,0:51:01.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看你对痛苦还蛮习惯的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you are no stranger to pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.76,0:51:07.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,或许你过去是我的越南同志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you have been among my Vietnamese comrades before?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.76,0:51:10.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.77,0:51:13.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要报名字吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wish to give your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.77,0:51:19.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,那会有什损失?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What possible harm can that cause?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.78,0:51:24.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可以用一些替代者交换情报员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pride is a poor substitute for intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.78,0:51:29.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,但你一定了解我们必须审问你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you must understand is that we have to interrogate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.79,0:51:31.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,对这里的某些人来说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Sergeant Yushin here,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.79,0:51:34.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只是实验的材料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're piece of meat,a laboratory experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.79,0:51:38.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我们 你也是同志和我一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to me, you are a comrade, similar to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.79,0:51:43.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,我刚被命运所阻止了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just opposed by an act of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.80,0:51:46.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你想救出战俘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you were trying to facilitate the release of war criminals held
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.80,0:51:51.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,这点我很了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by this Republic. I can appreciate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.81,0:51:57.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,但你被捕却是很难看的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this incident, your capture, is......embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.82,0:52:01.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一定有解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must have explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.82,0:52:04.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,但首先我想联络你的基地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First of all, I wish you to radio your headquarters,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.82,0:52:07.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,说你被捕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and say that you have been captured
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.82,0:52:10.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,罪名是进行间谍活动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and condemned for espionage activities
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.83,0:52:15.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且未来不可有同样的事发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that no such criminal agression should be attempted in the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.83,0:52:21.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们会遭遇与你相同的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or they will meet with the same fate as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.84,0:52:33.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.85,0:52:39.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想充英雄 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wish to test your strength...Good. Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.86,0:52:46.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,用刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yushin!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.92,0:53:48.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,同志 有件东西你可能会有兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comrade, here is something that might be of interest to you:
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.92,0:53:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你们直升机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A transcript of the conversation between
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.09,0:53:54.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对基地指挥官的对话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} your helicopter pilot and his commander we intercepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.93,0:54:00.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙号 呼叫狼儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dragonfly"... "Wolf's Den"...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.94,0:54:02.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,名字真富色彩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}colorful names!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.94,0:54:04.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are:
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.94,0:54:06.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们看到他们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We have them in sight."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.94,0:54:08.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,回答是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the reply:
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.94,0:54:12.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,马上停止行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Abort the operation immediately."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.95,0:54:18.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是撤消命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"This is a recall. Confirm. Over. "
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.95,0:54:22.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好像被遗弃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems you were abandoned by direct command.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.96,0:54:28.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些人就是你用痛苦来保护的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these are the people you protect...with your pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.97,0:54:33.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可以大叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.97,0:54:39.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,没什可耻的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.00,0:55:10.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,你很强壮 非常强壮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are strong...Very strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.01,0:55:12.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,目前是如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The strongest so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.01,0:55:16.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,你过一会你就会死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're nearly dead! Poor waif.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.01,0:55:21.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,向基地通讯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make the radio call.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.04,0:55:49.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,这样简单多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To talk, to obey would be so much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.06,0:56:06.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚欣要给你一些纪念{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yushin has a memento for you of this occasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.08,0:56:32.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,插入他的眼里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it in his eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.09,0:56:38.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的生命可能不算什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your own life means nothing to you
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.09,0:56:41.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,但他的就不同了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then perhaps his does.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.10,0:56:43.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么都不要说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell them anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.10,0:56:48.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.11,0:57:00.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,说啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.15,0:57:35.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要那么作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.15,0:57:36.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,说啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.15,0:57:41.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,快说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.18,0:58:12.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,22056...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two-two-O-five-six...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.19,0:58:15.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,狼穴 听到了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lone Wolf, receive.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.23,0:58:17.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里是一匹狼 22056{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Lone Wolf, two-two-O-five-six
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.19,0:58:20.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,一匹狼 这里是狼穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lone Wolf, this is Wolf's Den.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.20,0:58:22.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transmit location and status. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.83,0:58:24.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.20,0:58:27.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,是蓝波 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Rambo, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.20,0:58:32.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到了 你的位置在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We read you, Lone Wolf. What is your position? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.21,0:58:36.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在说一次你的位置在那儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say again: What is your position? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.21,0:58:41.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,如你不回答 你的朋友死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend dies if you do not answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.22,0:58:46.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 我是翰特 你在那?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny, this is Trautman. Where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.22,0:58:53.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 快回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.23,0:59:01.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,摩道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murdock?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.24,0:59:06.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.24,0:59:11.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波 我是摩道 真高兴你活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo, this is Murdock, we're glad you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.25,0:59:13.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.25,0:59:18.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,把位置告诉我们 我们去救你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us your position, and we'll come to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.26,0:59:29.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,摩道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murdock...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.26,0:59:34.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要去找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm comin' to get you!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.43,1:03:01.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.51,1:03:43.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们目前安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.52,1:03:48.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,你看来真可怕 蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like hell, Rambo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.52,1:03:51.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,那不重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tough night.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.53,1:03:56.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,或许你会需要这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.53,1:04:01.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你受伤了 - 没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You hurt bad. - It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.54,1:04:08.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.54,1:04:12.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,你所作的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you did back there...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.55,1:04:16.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会忘记的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I won't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.55,1:04:20.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.56,1:04:22.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在该怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.56,1:04:26.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,尝试到泰国去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to get across to Thailand?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.56,1:04:31.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后去美国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.Then go America?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.57,1:04:39.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会带我去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take me with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.58,1:04:52.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.59,1:05:00.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我认为你的选择是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you make good choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.60,1:05:05.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 走吗? - 我们走了吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We go? - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.73,1:05:40.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.64,1:05:52.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.65,1:05:56.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.65,1:05:59.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,不会忘了我吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not...forget...me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.65,1:06:04.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.67,1:06:19.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要援救小组在一小时候出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the rescue team ready to go in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.67,1:06:20.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在拿你的安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're risking your career,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.68,1:06:23.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的事业及你的家人冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your reputation, and even your family's security!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.68,1:06:26.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真的认为一个人值得付出吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you honestly think any one man's worth all that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.68,1:06:29.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要命令你撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting you a direct order to withdraw from this project.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.68,1:06:30.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是要给我援助小组{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I get the rescue team
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.69,1:06:31.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,还是要我自行行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or do I go over your head?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.69,1:06:36.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,有件事你似乎不明白这坪我负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't seem to understand something:
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.69,1:06:40.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只是工具或是机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in charge here. You're just a tool.We're the machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.70,1:06:45.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要逮捕你 不准你离开这坪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him placed under arrest. He's not to leave the base.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.70,1:06:49.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,他从来没有过机会对不?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never had a chance, did he?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.70,1:06:50.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像你所说的 中校!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you said, Colonel:
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.71,1:06:55.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,他回家去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went home.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.93,1:21:00.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.56,1:21:12.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,赶快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.57,1:21:17.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,搭直升机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C'mon! Go to the chopper! Move, move!Go to the chopper! Go to the chopper!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.23,1:21:21.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.93,1:21:23.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,搭飞机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the chopper!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.83,1:21:25.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.03,1:21:26.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.23,1:21:29.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,抓住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.59,1:21:40.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,快搭上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C'mon! Move it, move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.43,1:21:43.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,快快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.61,1:21:56.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man at the gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.62,1:22:14.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,干了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys made it!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.66,1:22:52.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,是敌机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chopper on our tail!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.67,1:22:57.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,要走了  抓稳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on!Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.43,1:24:33.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,朝尾部开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire in the tail!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.89,1:26:42.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,野狼呼叫狼基地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lone Wolf calling Wolf's Den. Over.Lone Wolf calling Wolf's Den. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.90,1:26:46.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,狼基地 我是一匹狼你收到吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wolf's Den, this is Lone wolf, do you read?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.90,1:26:50.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是野狼 你们收到吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wolf's den, this is Lone Wolf, over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.90,1:26:52.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 我们收到了 一匹野狼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we hear you, Lone Wolf. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.91,1:26:55.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,我请求降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for emergency landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.91,1:27:01.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,来到的是美国战俘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arriving with American POWs.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.92,1:27:15.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们听见了 快去迎接{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard!Prepare for arriving POWs! Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.00,1:28:36.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴你成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad you made it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.08,1:29:47.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波 我不是下令的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo, I don't make the orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.08,1:29:52.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你一样也是服从命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take'em, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.09,1:29:59.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对天发誓 不知会演变成如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to God I didn't know it was supposed to happen like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.09,1:30:04.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只是接受另一项任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just supposed to be another assignment.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.10,1:30:11.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.10,1:30:16.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,己完成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...accomplished!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.11,1:30:23.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你从一开始就知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know there's more men out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.12,1:30:27.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那地方的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.12,1:30:32.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,找回他们了 否则我会再找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find'em......or I'll find you!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.15,1:30:58.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 你去那里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John!Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.15,1:31:02.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.16,1:31:07.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想你应该为此而得到几个奖励{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get a second Medal of Honor for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.17,1:31:17.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,该给他们 他们才更该得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They should give it to them.They deserve it more.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.17,1:31:20.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,不能再关你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't keep running,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.17,1:31:22.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 你现在自由了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John. You're free now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.18,1:31:25.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,回我们这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.73,1:31:27.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,回到哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to what?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.18,1:31:32.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我朋友都死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends died here...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.19,1:31:36.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也等于死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Part of me died here...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.19,1:31:38.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,一切都是战争造成的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war, everything that happened here may have been wrong,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.19,1:31:43.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,别这么恨你的国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but dammit, don't hate your country for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.20,1:31:48.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我这就是这一型的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd die for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.20,1:31:53.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是你所追求的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.21,1:31:59.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.21,1:32:02.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,也是他们要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what they want,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.22,1:32:05.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,任何家伙来这只是为了付出胆识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and every other guy who came over here,and spilt his guts
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.22,1:32:10.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,他付出了他的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and gave everything he had, wants...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.22,1:32:14.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们为了国家 国家也要爱我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for our country to love us...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.23,1:32:19.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,就如我们爱他一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as much as WE love it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.23,1:32:24.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要的就是这一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.24,1:32:30.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要以何为生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How will you live, John?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.24,1:32:35.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,过一天是一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Day by day.
